      "problem": "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{-2{x}^{2}-23x-63}{(x+5)^{2}(x+4)}=\\frac{1}{x+5}-\\frac{2}{(x+5)^{2}}-\\frac{3}{x+4},\n$$\n\ncalculate $\\int \\frac{-2{x}^{2}-23x-63}{(x+5)^{2}(x+4)}\\,\\text{d}x.$",
      "worked_solution": "We rewrite our integral and integrate term by term to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{-2{x}^{2}-23x-63}{(x+5)^{2}(x+4)}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{1}{x+5}-\\frac{2}{(x+5)^{2}}-\\frac{3}{x+4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{x+5}\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int \\frac{1}{(x+5)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x-3\\int \\frac{1}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+5|+\\frac{2}{x+5}-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+4|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
